 {
  "id": "stop-5-1-35",
  "name": "1943 · Macedonia",
  "availability": "1943-01-01T00:00:00Z/1943-12-31T23:59:59Z",
  "description": "<h3>Begins underground activity; claims to work closely with Dr. G. M. Dimitrov in Macedonia</h3><p>Claim 'partially substantiated' by Dr. Dimitrov's 1947 letters (p66) but 'a claim which Dr. Dimitrov has denied' (p107).</p><table><tr><th align=left valign=top>Event</th><td>5 · underground</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Date</th><td>1943 · quality: claimed</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Place</th><td>Macedonia (region) · role: at</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Fix</th><td>41.3000, 22.3000 · MANUAL (manual)</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Basis</th><td>summary, self_account</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Place note</th><td>Fixed manually (see geocode_fixups.sh). The historical region across Greece, North Macedonia and Bulgaria; the file uses it loosely. 'Macedonian Mountains' (p137) attached here.</td></tr></table><p><b>Sources</b></p><ul><li>p4 <i>summary</i>: “DIMITROV claimed he began underground anti-Fascist activities in 1943 in Macedonia”</li><li>p29 <i>self_account</i>: “1943: began underground activities; worked closely with Dr. George M. DIMITROV”</li><li>p107 <i>summary</i> (1952-02-29): “worked closely with Dr. Georgi M. Dimitrov in anti-Fascist activities (a claim which Dr. Dimitrov has denied.)”</li></ul>",
