 {
  "id": "stop-14-1-2",
  "name": "1945 · Bulgaria",
  "availability": "1945-01-01T00:00:00Z/1946-12-31T23:59:59Z",
  "description": "<h3>Organizes some 250 'secret posts' across Bulgaria</h3><p>Grows in the retelling: 250 posts (1950); '250 cells consisting of some 10,000 persons throughout Bulgaria and Macedonia' (1953); '250 secret posts and ten thousand active members' (1960).</p><table><tr><th align=left valign=top>Event</th><td>14 · organizing</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Date</th><td>1945 → 1946 · quality: claimed</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Place</th><td>Bulgaria (country) · role: at</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Fix</th><td>42.7339, 25.4858 · APPROXIMATE (google)</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Basis</th><td>self_account</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Names in use</th><td>Boris Stoikov</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Place note</th><td>Cryptonym 'Dreamland' (p83, p114) read as Bulgaria; tentative.</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Event note</th><td>Dr. G. M. Dimitrov's demand for the names of these posts is what Diko gives as the cause of their break (p71).</td></tr></table><p><b>Sources</b></p><ul><li>p30 <i>self_account</i>: “Travelled through Bulgaria organizing \"secret posts\" - some 250”</li><li>p98 <i>self_account</i> (1953-07-21): “he had organized over 250 cells consisting of some 10,000 persons throughout Bulgaria and Macedonia”</li><li>p139 <i>self_account</i> (1960-06-28): “At its peak it had consisted of 250 secret posts and ten thousand active members”</li></ul>",
