  "description": "<h3>In Sofia in contact with Dr. G. M. Dimitrov, Nikola Petkov and Mara Raicheva; asks US and UK officers at Skopje for help reaching Bari</h3><table><tr><th align=left valign=top>Event</th><td>11 · contact</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Date</th><td>1945-04 → 1945-05 · quality: stated</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Place</th><td>Sofia (city) · role: at</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Fix</th><td>42.6977, 23.3219 · APPROXIMATE (google)</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Basis</th><td>self_account</td></tr></table><p><b>Sources</b></p><ul><li>p30 <i>self_account</i>: “April-May 1945: In Sofia in contact with G.M. DIMITROV, Nikola PETKOV, and Mara RAICHEVA”</li><li>p67 <i>self_account</i> (1950-10-13): “After Diko learned that GeMe had left Bulgaria, he went to Skoplje and asked American and English officers there to help him get to Bari. He did not receive such help”</li></ul>",
