  "availability": "1946-10-13T00:00:00Z/1946-11-11T23:59:59Z",
  "description": "<h3>Tried in the Vratsa court for 'having organized subversive groups all over Bulgaria'; sentenced on four counts including death; solitary confinement</h3><p>Chief prosecutor Chernev, presiding judge Pencho Spasov (p68).</p><table><tr><th align=left valign=top>Event</th><td>17 · trial</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Date</th><td>1946-10-13 → 1946-11-11 · quality: stated</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Place</th><td>Vratsa (city) · role: at</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Fix</th><td>43.2102, 23.5529 · APPROXIMATE (google)</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Basis</th><td>self_account</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Place note</th><td>Court, prison and quarry, 1944-47.</td></tr></table><p><b>Sources</b></p><ul><li>p31 <i>self_account</i>: “13.10 - 11.11.46: tried in Vratsa Court ... Sentenced on four counts: to death, 15 years, 6 years, and 3 years”</li><li>p68 <i>self_account</i> (1950-10-13): “From October 13 to November 11, 1946, Diko was tried in the Vratsa court”</li><li>p98 <i>self_account</i> (1953-07-21): “tried and found guilty on four counts and imprisoned”</li></ul>",
