  "description": "<h3>Escapes from the quarry; Mezdra, Zverova, Sofia; helped by British and Americans; sleeps at Jack Horner's house</h3><p>1953 version: 'Early in 1947' escaped through members of his organization, tried to reach General Crane, was fobbed off by 'Mr. Horne' (p98-99). 1960 version: 'rescued by the underground, which sent him to the house of the US Ambassador' (p139).</p><table><tr><th align=left valign=top>Event</th><td>20 · escape</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Date</th><td>1947-07-08 · quality: conflicting</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Place</th><td>Simeonovo (village) · role: via</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Fix</th><td>42.6145, 23.3365 · APPROXIMATE (google)</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Basis</th><td>self_account</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Names in use</th><td>Diko</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Other dates</th><td>p98 says 1947; p139 says 1947</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Link note</th><td>Jack Horner's summer home.</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Place note</th><td>Jack Horner's summer home, July 1947 (p68). Now a Sofia suburb.</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Event note</th><td>Date conflict: 8 July 1947 (1950 account) vs 'early in 1947' (1953 account).</td></tr></table><p><b>Sources</b></p><ul><li>p31 <i>self_account</i>: “8 July 1947: escaped from quarry, went to Mesdra, from there to Zverova, then Sofia, where he received help from British and Americans. Slept on one occasion in Sofia house of Jack HORNER”</li><li>p68 <i>self_account</i> (1950-10-13): “On July 8, he escaped from the quarry and went to Mesdra ... He claims that on one occasion he slept in the Sofia house of Jack Horner, of the American Legation”</li><li>p98 <i>self_account</i> (1953-07-21): “Early in 1947 through members of his organization he was able to make his escape from the prison”</li><li>p139 <i>self_account</i> (1960-06-28): “In 1947 he was working in a labor gang and was rescued by the