  "description": "<h3>British hospital at Xanthi (18 days), then British hospital at Salonika (about six weeks)</h3><table><tr><th align=left valign=top>Event</th><td>23 · hospital</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Date</th><td>1947-08 → 1947-09 · quality: circa</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Place</th><td>Xanthi (city) · role: at</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Fix</th><td>41.1363, 24.8877 · APPROXIMATE (google)</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Basis</th><td>self_account</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Names in use</th><td>Diko</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Link note</th><td>18 days.</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Place note</th><td>British hospital, Aug 1947.</td></tr></table><p><b>Sources</b></p><ul><li>p31 <i>self_account</i>: “c. August 1947: admitted to British hospital in Xanthi; 18 days later transferred to British hospital in Salonika”</li><li>p68 <i>self_account</i> (1950-10-13): “After eighteen days in the hospital there he was transferred to the British hospital in Salonika. After a month and a half in Salonika he was sent to Athens”</li></ul>",
