 {
  "id": "stop-24-1-65",
  "name": "1947-09 · Athens (via)",
  "availability": "1947-09-01T00:00:00Z/1947-09-02T00:00:00Z",
  "description": "<h3>Sent to Athens; Greek authorities place him in the Lavrion refugee camp for nine months</h3><table><tr><th align=left valign=top>Event</th><td>24 · camp</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Date</th><td>1947-09 → 1948-06 · quality: circa</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Place</th><td>Athens (city) · role: via</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Fix</th><td>37.9838, 23.7275 · APPROXIMATE (google)</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Basis</th><td>self_account</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Names in use</th><td>Diko</td></tr></table><p><b>Sources</b></p><ul><li>p31 <i>self_account</i>: “c. mid-September 1947: sent to Athens. Greeks sent him to refugee camp at Lavrion. Stayed 9 months”</li><li>p68 <i>self_account</i> (1950-10-13): “Greek authorities sent him to the refugee camp at Lavrion. Diko spent nine months in Lavrion”</li></ul>",
  "position": {
   "cartographicDegrees": [
