  "id": "stop-31-2-71",
  "name": "1950-04-15 · Hotel Action, New Phaleron (to)",
  "availability": "1950-04-15T00:00:00Z/1950-04-15T23:59:59Z",
  "description": "<h3>Vakrel Yanev writes from Paris to 'Dimiter Adamov Dimotrov, Hotel Action, New Phaleron' about the Agrarian split, the 'Barevites' and a planned newspaper</h3><p>Enclosure 9 to ATHENS 588.</p><table><tr><th align=left valign=top>Event</th><td>31 · correspondence</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Date</th><td>1950-04-15 · quality: stated</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Place</th><td>Hotel Action, New Phaleron (hotel) · in the file: “New Phaleron” · role: to</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Fix</th><td>37.9486, 23.6595 · APPROXIMATE (google)</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Basis</th><td>document</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Names in use</th><td>Diko</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Place note</th><td>Address on Vakrel Yanev's letter of 15 Apr 1950 (p81). Hotel not located; fix is Neo Faliro.</td></tr></table><p><b>Sources</b></p><ul><li>p81 <i>document</i> (1950-04-15): “from: Vakrel Yanev, 37, Rue de Berne, Paris 8, France; to: Dimiter Adamov Dimotrov, Hotel Action, New Phaleron, Greece; date: April 15, 1950”</li></ul>",
