 {
  "id": "stop-32-1-73",
  "name": "1950-04-30 · Lavrion refugee camp",
  "availability": "1950-04-30T00:00:00Z/1950-04-30T23:59:59Z",
  "description": "<h3>'P. D. Petkov Organization' formed at Lavrion camp; Dimitrov on its Board of Control</h3><p>Protocol signed 30 April 1950; members had 'deserted the Bulgarian Agrarian Party in an effort to retain their \"pure\" agrarian character' (p7). He 'has taken over and expanded the activities of this group, and now considers himself its leader' (p70); claims 12 hard-core members and 54 supporters (p33, p70).</p><table><tr><th align=left valign=top>Event</th><td>32 · organizing</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Date</th><td>1950-04-30 · quality: stated</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Place</th><td>Lavrion refugee camp (camp) · in the file: “Lavrion” · role: at</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Fix</th><td>37.7130, 24.0564 · APPROXIMATE (google)</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Basis</th><td>document, summary</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Names in use</th><td>Diko</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Place note</th><td>Greek camp for Bulgarian and other refugees, 1947-50s. Fix is the town.</td></tr></table><p><b>Sources</b></p><ul><li>p7 <i>document</i> (1950-09-16): “Protocol signed on 30 April 1950 ... DIMITROV's name appears as a member of the Board of Control”</li><li>p33 <i>summary</i>: “30 April 1950: Made a member of the \"P.D. PETKOV\" organization formed in Lavrion”</li><li>p70 <i>document</i> (1950-10-13): “Diko was made a member of the \"P. D. Petkov\" organization which was formed in Lavrion on April 30, 1950”</li></ul>",
  "position": {
