 {
  "id": "stop-34-1-73",
  "name": "1950-09-23 · Lavrion refugee camp",
  "availability": "1950-09-23T00:00:00Z/1950-09-23T23:59:59Z",
  "description": "<h3>Organizes a memorial service at Lavrion for the third anniversary of Nikola Petkov's hanging</h3><p>About sixty attended (Diko said eighty); mass, speech, wreath at the town soldiers' monument, tavern; cost 870,000 drachmae, half paid by Diko; no 'Gemetoists' present (p72). Photographs are enclosure 10 (p74).</p><table><tr><th align=left valign=top>Event</th><td>34 · speech</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Date</th><td>1950-09-23 · quality: stated</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Place</th><td>Lavrion refugee camp (camp) · in the file: “Lavrion” · role: at</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Fix</th><td>37.7130, 24.0564 · APPROXIMATE (google)</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Basis</th><td>document, summary</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Names in use</th><td>Diko</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Place note</th><td>Greek camp for Bulgarian and other refugees, 1947-50s. Fix is the town.</td></tr></table><p><b>Sources</b></p><ul><li>p33 <i>summary</i>: “23 September 1950: Organized memorial service in Lavrion”</li><li>p72 <i>document</i> (1950-10-13): “On Saturday, September 23, 1950, Diko organized a memorial service in Lavrion, commemorating the third anniversary of the hanging of Nikola Petkov”</li></ul>",
  "position": {
