 {
  "id": "stop-53-1-65",
  "name": "1951-04-13 · Athens",
  "availability": "1951-04-13T00:00:00Z/1951-04-17T23:59:59Z",
  "description": "<h3>Sees Florimond on Friday 13, Saturday 14 and Tuesday 17 April against orders; on the 17th also meets Assistant Military Attaché Piray</h3><table><tr><th align=left valign=top>Event</th><td>53 · contact</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Date</th><td>1951-04-13 → 1951-04-17 · quality: stated</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Place</th><td>Athens (city) · role: at</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Fix</th><td>37.9838, 23.7275 · APPROXIMATE (google)</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Basis</th><td>document, summary</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Names in use</th><td>Diko; Lyle O. Kelly</td></tr></table><p><b>Sources</b></p><ul><li>p23 <i>document</i> (1951-04-18): “DIMITROV saw FLORIMOND on Friday (13th), Saturday (14th) and on Tuesday (17th). On the latter day he also saw a certain French assistant military attache named PIRAY”</li><li>p33 <i>summary</i>: “13, 14, 17 April 1951: Saw FLORIMOND (in direct violation of our orders)”</li><li>p115 <i>document</i> (1951-05-18): “We know definitely that Kelly did see this Fairy on the following Friday, Saturday, and Tuesday”</li></ul>",
