  "description": "<h3>ATHE 5282: moved from the Aliens Directorate to Makronisos, to be held by the Greek Intelligence Service</h3><p>The Greek-island detention of Dimitrov's 1960 account ('kept there four months', then a second island, p140) fits here.</p><table><tr><th align=left valign=top>Event</th><td>61 · transfer</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Date</th><td>1951-04-29 · quality: stated</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Place</th><td>Makronisos (island) · role: to</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Fix</th><td>37.7303, 24.1380 · APPROXIMATE (google)</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Basis</th><td>document, self_account</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Names in use</th><td>Diko; Lyle O. Kelly</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Other dates</th><td>p140 says 1951</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Place note</th><td>Detention island; Kelly moved there 29 Apr 1951. The 1960 account's 'a Greek island' (p140) is read as this, tentatively.</td></tr></table><p><b>Sources</b></p><ul><li>p118 <i>document</i> (1951-05-09): “Athe 5282 (IN 37839) indicated on 29 April 1951 that Dimitrov had been transferred from the Greek Aliens Directorate to Makronisis where he would be held by the Greek Intelligence Service”</li><li>p140 <i>self_account</i> (1960-06-28): “Allen arranged for him to be taken to a Greek island ... He was kept there four months”</li></ul>",
