  "name": "1953-05-15 · Fort Clayton",
  "availability": "1953-05-15T00:00:00Z/1953-05-15T23:59:59Z",
  "description": "<h3>Released from confinement at DTROBALO to attend classes and live with others being prepared for resettlement</h3><table><tr><th align=left valign=top>Event</th><td>84 · detention</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Date</th><td>1953-05-15 · quality: circa</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Place</th><td>Fort Clayton (base, now Ciudad del Saber (Clayton)) · in the file: “Fort Clayton, Panama” · role: at</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Fix</th><td>9.0014, -79.5814 · APPROXIMATE (google)</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Basis</th><td>document</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Names in use</th><td>Diko; Lyle O. Kelly</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Place note</th><td>US Army post in the Canal Zone; CIA holding facility DTROBALO/DTRABALO. Kelly held here 4 Sep 1951 - Jan 1954. Since 1999 the Ciudad del Saber campus.</td></tr></table><p><b>Sources</b></p><ul><li>p97 <i>document</i> (1953-07-21): “KELLY had been in detention until approximately 15 May when he was released from confinement and allowed to attend classes”</li></ul>",
