  "name": "1956-11-26 · New York City (to)",
  "availability": "1956-11-26T00:00:00Z/1956-11-27T00:00:00Z",
  "description": "<h3>Arrives in New York; 'entire family admitted as permanent residents on 26.11.56'; works as a janitor in Newark</h3><table><tr><th align=left valign=top>Event</th><td>92 · immigration</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Date</th><td>1956-11-26 · quality: stated</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Place</th><td>New York City (city) · in the file: “New York” · role: to</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Fix</th><td>40.7128, -74.0060 · APPROXIMATE (google)</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Basis</th><td>summary, self_account</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Names in use</th><td>Diko; Lyle O. Kelly</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Other dates</th><td>p57 says 1956</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Link note</th><td>Port of arrival.</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Event note</th><td>The 1958 press profile says he came 'fourteen months ago' (i.e. c. Feb 1957) - loose.</td></tr></table><p><b>Sources</b></p><ul><li>p36 <i>summary</i>: “entire family admitted as permanent residents on 26.11.56”</li><li>p57 <i>summary</i> (1964-01-20): “Subject immigrated to the United States in 1956”</li><li>p141 <i>self_account</i> (1960-06-28): “He arrived in New York in November 1956 with the intention of writing his story in an Anti-Communist book. At first he worked as a janitor in Newark”</li></ul>",
