  "description": "<h3>Madrid Embassy liaison: 'a source of unknown reliability reported in 1965 that Diko DIMITROFF had connections with the Bulgarian Intelligence Service and with a dissident group in Bulgaria'</h3><table><tr><th align=left valign=top>Event</th><td>113 · trace</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Date</th><td>1965 · quality: stated</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Place</th><td>Madrid (city) · role: at</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Fix</th><td>40.4167, -3.7033 · APPROXIMATE (google)</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Basis</th><td>document · Madrid liaison trace reports him in Madrid in 1965</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Names in use</th><td>Diko; Lyle O. Kelly; Diko Dimitroff</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Place note</th><td>His office, 1965.</td></tr></table><p><b>Sources</b></p><ul><li>p40 <i>document</i> (1969-07-24): “A source of unknown reliability reported in 1965 that Diko DIMITROFF had connections with the Bulgarian Intelligence Service and with a dissident group in Bulgaria”</li></ul>",
