 {
  "id": "stop-122-1-65",
  "name": "1969-07 · Athens",
  "availability": "1969-07-01T00:00:00Z/1969-07-31T23:59:59Z",
  "description": "<h3>LNEASE's pre-marital investigation of Kalliopi Geralexis surfaces his claim to have worked for WOFIRM; Athens Station dispatch NKAA-2613 'PBRAMPART - Dimitrios DIMITROF' asks HQ for traces</h3><p>Address c/o Marjorie Dare, New York; 'Movie film producer'; travels to Italy, France, England, Switzerland. Athens tells LNEASE he 'has no connection with WOFIRM' (p40).</p><table><tr><th align=left valign=top>Event</th><td>122 · trace</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Date</th><td>1969-07 · quality: stated</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Place</th><td>Athens (city) · role: at</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Fix</th><td>37.9838, 23.7275 · APPROXIMATE (google)</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Basis</th><td>document · Greek liaison pre-marital investigation places him in Athens, Jul 1969</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Names in use</th><td>Diko; Dico; General Dico Dimitrov; Lyle O. Kelly; PBRAMPART</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Other dates</th><td>p37 says 1969-07-17</td></tr><tr><th align=left valign=top>Event note</th><td>NKAA-2613 dated 17 July 1969 per p37; the copy on p40 carries a handwritten 24 Jul.</td></tr></table><p><b>Sources</b></p><ul><li>p37 <i>document</i> (1969-08-25): “reference: NKAA-02613, 17 July 1969”</li><li>p40 <i>document</i> (1969-07-24): “Subject came to Station attention as a result of a pre-marital investigation which was being conducted by LNEASE on Kalliopi Stylianou GERALEXIS”</li></ul>",
  "position": {
